{"4204530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Knights End", "steam_appid": 4204530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shift has begun. You have been banished to working the dangerous nights, performing menial tasks to serve the kingdom’s villagers. Complete a growing number of tasks each night to gain honor and earn your place on the watch in this unforgiving world. How long can you and your team survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Obey Your Villagers' Commands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your fellow knights must earn honor for items and your survival, by braving the darkness of the night to fulfill the villager’s demeaning requests: retrieve forgotten items for the village drunk, feed the horses for the forgetful farmers, catch fish in the lake for the hungry, mine gems in the forest caves for the greedy merchant. The villagers will command more tasks from you as  you prove yourself useful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/bb25fa9fc9892a7f459056c576a89e3a.poster.avif?t=1782375874\" aria-label=\"A montage of a knight receiving a quest, mining a gem, feeding a horse, fishing, and returning the fish to the villager.\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/bb25fa9fc9892a7f459056c576a89e3a.webm?t=1782375874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/bb25fa9fc9892a7f459056c576a89e3a.mp4?t=1782375874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beware The Night's Horrors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware that which hides in the night. As you progress further, more enemies and new horrors appear to stop you from fulfilling your duties to the kingdom. Use your wits to evade them, and acquire weapons and traps at the merchant to fend them off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/c2258bd4b438e3345ed4267c83e1070f.poster.avif?t=1782375874\" aria-label=\"A montage of knights evading a falling trap, being attacked by enemies, and running through the knight.\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/c2258bd4b438e3345ed4267c83e1070f.webm?t=1782375874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/c2258bd4b438e3345ed4267c83e1070f.mp4?t=1782375874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine Forces with Fellow Knights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is strength in numbers. Looking for more knights? Join the Discord server! Band together with other knights to aid in your search, but be careful if they are taken by the night. Why risk your life for theirs, when even more honor could be lost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/c460a6e22f4cd516715487562389e154.poster.avif?t=1782375874\" aria-label=\"A montage of knights talking to each other, running out the gates, grabbing fishing poles, running through a gulch, and mining.\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/c460a6e22f4cd516715487562389e154.webm?t=1782375874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/c460a6e22f4cd516715487562389e154.mp4?t=1782375874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shift has begun. You have been banished to working the dangerous nights, performing menial tasks to serve the kingdom’s villagers. Complete a growing number of tasks each night to gain honor and earn your place on the watch in this unforgiving world. How long can you and your team survive?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Obey Your Villagers' Commands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your fellow knights must earn honor for items and your survival, by braving the darkness of the night to fulfill the villager’s demeaning requests: retrieve forgotten items for the village drunk, feed the horses for the forgetful farmers, catch fish in the lake for the hungry, mine gems in the forest caves for the greedy merchant. The villagers will command more tasks from you as  you prove yourself useful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/bb25fa9fc9892a7f459056c576a89e3a.poster.avif?t=1782375874\" aria-label=\"A montage of a knight receiving a quest, mining a gem, feeding a horse, fishing, and returning the fish to the villager.\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/bb25fa9fc9892a7f459056c576a89e3a.webm?t=1782375874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/bb25fa9fc9892a7f459056c576a89e3a.mp4?t=1782375874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beware The Night's Horrors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware that which hides in the night. As you progress further, more enemies and new horrors appear to stop you from fulfilling your duties to the kingdom. Use your wits to evade them, and acquire weapons and traps at the merchant to fend them off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/c2258bd4b438e3345ed4267c83e1070f.poster.avif?t=1782375874\" aria-label=\"A montage of knights evading a falling trap, being attacked by enemies, and running through the knight.\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/c2258bd4b438e3345ed4267c83e1070f.webm?t=1782375874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/c2258bd4b438e3345ed4267c83e1070f.mp4?t=1782375874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine Forces with Fellow Knights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is strength in numbers. Looking for more knights? Join the Discord server! Band together with other knights to aid in your search, but be careful if they are taken by the night. Why risk your life for theirs, when even more honor could be lost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/c460a6e22f4cd516715487562389e154.poster.avif?t=1782375874\" aria-label=\"A montage of knights talking to each other, running out the gates, grabbing fishing poles, running through a gulch, and mining.\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204530/extras/c460a6e22f4cd516715487562389e154.webm?t=1782375874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source 